{
  "abstract": "We give resonant and production cross-sections for the \u039e*-resonances produced in the reactions \u039e\u2212K+\u03c00 and \u039e\u2212\u03c0+K0 for 7 incident-K\u2212 momenta between 1.93 and 2.52 GeV/c. A partial-wave analysis gives evidence for the existence of a resonance in theD5-state in this mass region.",
